## components/game/ (Check!-specific gameplay UI — the bulk of the rewrite)

- AbilityMoment.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Split 13 has no special-card abilities; remove or repurpose.
- ActionBarComponent.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Split 13's only action is "throw a card"; simplify drastically.
- ActionButton.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — depends on new, much smaller action set.
- ActionController.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — depends on new turn-action flow (throw only, no draw/swap/ability choices).
- ActionControllerView.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — same, follows ActionController.
- ActionFactories.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — action set is entirely different.
- CheckMoment.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Split 13 has no "Call Check"; remove or repurpose.
- GameBoard.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — major: needs 4-seat layout with team score piles instead of Check!'s per-player grid layout.
- GameEventCaption.tsx — [WARNING] — overlay mechanism likely reusable; event text/types need Split 13's vocabulary (capture, throw) instead of Check!'s (match, peek, ability).
- GameHeader.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — needs a 20s turn timer, both teams' live scores, and the live total value of the table stack, instead of Check!'s per-turn-phase info (see design-vault/Redesign/Split 13 - Game Rules.md §5, §9).
- GameLobby.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — major: fixed 4 seats mapped to Team A/B, bot-fill, instead of Check!'s 2-6 variable lobby.
- GameUI.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — composition root; follows once its children are rebuilt.
- HandGrid.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Check!'s 2x2 grid has no Split 13 equivalent (13-card fanned hand instead); replace.
- LearnCheckSheet.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — rewrite content for Split 13 rules, or add a parallel component.
- MatchMoment.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Split 13 has no separate matching-stage window (capture happens on the throw itself); remove or repurpose.
- PenaltyMoment.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Split 13 has no penalty-card mechanic; remove.
- PlayerHand.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — major: renders a 4-card face-down grid; Split 13 needs a 13-card, always-face-up-to-owner hand.
- PlayerHandStrip.tsx — [WARNING] — opponent hand-count strip concept is similar; verify it fits 13-card counts and the 4-seat layout.
- RoundSummary.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — Split 13 has no hidden-hand reveal moment; needs a team-score summary instead.
- TableArea.tsx — [NEEDS WORK] — one capture stack instead of separate draw/discard piles.
- useGameSounds.ts — [NEEDS WORK] — remove sound events for cut mechanics (peek/ability/match/penalty/check), add one for capture.

